<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-ZIMBABWE 141 AND 162-6 V SRI LANKA (350-8 DEC) AT CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ZIMBABWE 141 AND 162-6 V SRI LANKA (350-8 DEC) AT CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zimbabwe were 162 for six in</p>
<p>their second innings at the close on the third day of the second</p>
<p>test against Sri Lanka on Friday.</p>
<p>Scores: Zimbabwe 141 and 162-6; Sri Lanka 350-8 declared.</p>
</text>
